## ⚠️ Limitations

* Regex-based parsing (not AST-level accuracy)
* No caching for LLM calls
* Limited handling of very large repositories
* Basic security (no authentication yet)

---

## 🚀 Future Improvements

* AST-based parsing for higher accuracy
* Graph visualization UI
* Caching & batching for LLM calls
* Authentication (JWT)
* Support for additional languages

